source:
Add a custom copy action to the issue's actions following the format you want.
Available keys: {ISSUE_TITLE}, {ISSUE_ID}, {ISSUE_URL}, {ISSUE_BRANCH_NAME}
Example: '{ISSUE_ID}: {ISSUE_TITLE} ({ISSUE_URL})'

previous:
